window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She just wants to retire. But the High Fae have a job for her. Recover a stolen relic before disaster strikes.</b><br> <br> Ryleigh Matthews has lost her wife, the love of her life, and wonders what’s left. She’ll sit on the porch in her rocker and...do what? But the King of the High Fae has a job for her. To find a magical crystal ball that’s been missing for thousands of years. An orb that will save her world and theirs.<br> <br> Searching for this ancient artifact, Ryleigh is trailed by a sinister magician. And after the dark sorcerer steals the crystal ball, Ryleigh must prevent him from handing it over to the fallen angel he serves.<br> <br> Can Ryleigh rescue the orb before multiple worlds fall into supernatural oblivion?<br> <br> <i>The Crone and the Stolen Orb </i>is the captivating first novel in the Witch of Spirit Springs paranormal women’s fiction series. If you like strong heroines, hunts for ancient objects, and magical towns, you’ll love Theresa Crater’s spellbinding tale.<br> <br> Download <i>The Crone and the Stolen Orb </i>to cross into a mythical thriller today!</p>"; 
